From 6af98188d79b5cdeb9f0463eca2abb5b39d3d95d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:13:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] v4l2: Wrap MT21C-only decoders with the converter that
 reads MT21C

A decoder whose only output is MT21C is useless to players, which
auto-plug decoders by rank and expect raw video. Register it with rank
NONE and add a bin, v4l2<codec>convdec, of the decoder and the first
converter that accepts MT21C, with the decoder's rank. The frames go
across as dmabufs: copying them would cut off what follows the picture
in MT21C, whose size only the decoder knows.

Local enablement for MT8173 (suez); not sent.
---
